# Node.js Tutorial Application - Root .gitignore
# Express.js 5.1.0 with TypeScript and Node.js 24.x
# Comprehensive project-wide file exclusion patterns
# Coordinates with backend/.gitignore and infrastructure/.dockerignore
# Educational tutorial application with production-ready practices

# =============================================================================
# OPERATING SYSTEM FILES
# Platform-specific system files and metadata
# Cross-platform compatibility for Windows, macOS, and Linux
